    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what someone who feels guilty would say. if i were actually a good person, i wouldn't feel this way. i'd feel like i belonged. the fact that this weight is so heavy, it's like it's telling me something true. it's like there's a part of me that knows i'm just a mistake that hasn't been corrected yet. wouldn't it be more logical for the world to just be... lighter without me in it?",
